From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 23:25:43 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali-oneplus-iceland: the Wi-Fi
 hardware has no SBS

The vendor's Wi-Fi configuration for the Pad 4 disables SBS (enable_sbs=0,
"the hardware does not support sbs mode"). Without it scans that cover the
whole 5 GHz band lose the networks on channels 36-64.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
index 26a1eb8cd4b6..abe082adcab2 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
@@ -1261,6 +1261,9 @@ wifi@0 {
 		compatible = "pci17cb,110e";
 		reg = <0x10000 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0>;
 
+		/* stock: enable_sbs=0, "the hardware does not support sbs mode" */
+		qcom,no-sbs;
+
 		vddrfacmn-supply = <&vreg_pmu_rfa_cmn>;
 		vddaon-supply = <&vreg_pmu_aon_0p59>;
 		vddwlcx-supply = <&vreg_pmu_wlcx_0p8>;
-- 
2.43.0

